Thanks. It looks like X_det is created as a 5-dimensional array but used in model code as two-dimensional:

    mu_l_p[j] <- inprod(delta[1:ndelta], X_det[j, 1:ndelta])

The error message is saying that dimensions for X_det need to be consistent. So X_det would need 5 indices when used in the model. If that is not clear, can you say more of what you are trying to do with X_det?

